  "support": "A marble plaque, missing the upper left corner, and with part of the surviving upper section also broken but still attached. The upper, left and right edges are straight, but the lower edge very uneven. Traces of mortar around the edges. The letters show extensive traces of red rubrication. The rear is finished smooth. A label on the reverse reads 'S. Giovanni 2014'.",
